rtitioning","d":"Swapping"},{"q":"What is the brain of the computer system?","a":"RAM","b":"Hard Disk","c":"Central Processing Unit (CPU)","d":"Motherboard"},{"q":"What does HTML stand for? (Study Guide Question)","a":"Hyper Text Markup Language","b":"Home Tool Markup Language","c":"Hyperlinks and Text Markup Language","d":"Hyper Tool Markup Language"},{"q":"Who is making the Web standards?","a":"Mozilla","b":"Google","c":"The World Wide Web Consortium (W3C)","d":"Microsoft"},{"q":"Choose the correct HTML element for the largest heading:","a":"<h6>","b":"<h1>","c":"<heading>","d":"<head>"},{"q":"What is the correct HTML element for inserting a line break?","a":"<break>","b":"<br>","c":"<lb>","d":"<hr>"},{"q":"What is the correct HTML for adding a background color?","a":"<body bg=\"yellow\">","b":"<body style=\"background-color:yellow;\">","c":"<background>yellow</background>","d":"<body color=\"yellow\">"},{"q":"Choose the correct HTML element to define important text: (Study Guide Question)","a":"<strong>","b":"<important>","c":"<i>","d":"<b>"},{"q":"Choose the correct HTML element to define emphasized text:","a":"<i>","b":"<em>","c":"<italic>","d":"<emphasize>"},{"q":"Which attribute is used to specify a unique identifier for an HTML element?","a":"class","b":"id","c":"style","d":"name"},{"q":"What is the correct HTML for creating a hyperlink?","a":"<a href=\"http://www.mcqsolve.com\">MCQsolve</a>","b":"<a url=\"http://www.mcqsolve.com\">MCQsolve</a>","c":"<a>http://www.mcqsolve.com</a>","d":"<a name=\"http://www.mcqsolve.com\">MCQsolve</a>"},{"q":"Which HTML attribute specifies an alternate text for an image, if the image cannot be displayed?","a":"title","b":"src","c":"alt","d":"longdesc"},{"q":"Which input type defines a slider control? (Study Guide Question)","a":"search","b":"controls","c":"slider","d":"range"},{"q":"Which HTML element is used to define a multi-line input control?","a":"<input type=\"textbox\">","b":"<textarea>","c":"<input type=\"textarea\">